  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Feeding Practices for first 1,000 Days</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to improve the feeding practices among 5,520 targeted women of reproductive age (including pregnant and lactating women) and 4,900 children under two (the so-called &quot;&quot;first 1,000 days of life&quot;&quot;) in Kassena, Nankana, Sekyere East, and Kintampo South Districts. &quot;</narrative>
  </description>
